warning[union_read]: `v.text` reads a union member, but nothing here says it is the live one
  --> tests/lint/union_read/bad.jai:23:12
   |
23 |     return v.text;
   |            ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: check `v.kind` first, or write `v.text` here before reading it
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/union_read

